      "raw": "So... I stumbled upon a game that cannot be won or lost.\n\nSentinels of the Multiverse. Team version. Hero team includes Visionary and does not include any heroes who can move cards back onto their deck. The villain team includes Miss Information and Fright Train and does not include any villains that can move cards back onto the deck (like Ermine).\n\nVisionary gets Decoy Projection out. Miss Information gets Unshackled Destiny out. Fright Train gets Major Flay out.\n\nSince Major Flay's nemesis power when Visionary is present is that Villain ongoing cards are indestructible, the Unshackled Destiny card cannot be destroyed. If you reduce any target to zero, Unshackled Destiny means that that target isn't destroyed. Then Unshackled Destiny isn't destroyed either.\n\nThis means you can't kill any target, including Major Flay.\n\nIt also means Visionary can't die. Anything that hits her gets diverted to Decoy Projection, which Unshackled Destiny then saves from destruction.\n\nMajor Flay prevents Unshackled Destiny from being destroyed. Unshackled Destiny prevents all targets from being destroyed. You can't get rid of Visionary to undo Major Flay's special bonus.\n\nThe only way I can see to get out of this is if one of the other heroes or villains can move a card back onto its deck instead of destroying it, but if you don't have those characters in the game... you're stuck.",
