      "cooked": "<p>Off the Rails in the Fright Train deck could get rid of Decoy Projection as Unshackled Destiny only prevents destruction through damage.  Where Off the Rails just destroys a target with 2 or fewer health not through damage.  Overall, it’s a bad setup to run into.</p>",
