      "username": "FrivYeti",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
      "created_at": "2026-04-23T15:58:36.572Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That’s a pretty good (by which I mean disastrous) combo. But you will eventually lose the game if it comes out.</p>\n<p><strong>Unshackled Destiny</strong> reads: “If damage would reduce a target to zero or fewer HP, prevent that damage, then destroy this card.” Notably, it doesn’t stop targets from being <em>destroyed</em>, it stops them from taking damage.</p>\n<p>Fright Train has a card called <strong>Off The Rails</strong>: Fright Train deals the Hero target with the highest HP 3 projectile damage. Destroy 1 Hero target with 2 or fewer HP.</p>\n<p>And ping damage to Visionary is getting redirected to the Decoy Projection. Eventually, it will drop to 1-2 HP. When it does, the next time Fright Train plays <strong>Off The Rails</strong> he’ll kill the Decoy Projection, bypassing Unshackled Destiny. He will then slowly ping Visionary down until <em>she’s</em> at 2 or fewer HP, at which point the next <strong>Off The Rails</strong> will kill her.</p>\n<p>This will take a very long time.</p>",
