      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "That's a pretty good (by which I mean disastrous) combo. But you will eventually lose the game if it comes out.\n\n**Unshackled Destiny** reads: \"If damage would reduce a target to zero or fewer HP, prevent that damage, then destroy this card.\" Notably, it doesn't stop targets from being *destroyed*, it stops them from taking damage.\n\nFright Train has a card called **Off The Rails**: Fright Train deals the Hero target with the highest HP 3 projectile damage. Destroy 1 Hero target with 2 or fewer HP.\n\nAnd ping damage to Visionary is getting redirected to the Decoy Projection. Eventually, it will drop to 1-2 HP. When it does, the next time Fright Train plays **Off The Rails** he'll kill the Decoy Projection, bypassing Unshackled Destiny. He will then slowly ping Visionary down until *she's* at 2 or fewer HP, at which point the next **Off The Rails** will kill her.\n\nThis will take a very long time.",
