      "username": "Griff_s_Dad",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-04-23T20:01:32.352Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, folks. Thanks for the pointer. I actually won the game.</p>\n<p>The first thing I did was drive everybody on the villain side down to 1-2 HP. Now they were doing the same to the heroes, so it was neck and neck. The second thing I did was have my other heroes save their area effect cards (Bowman’s fire arrow for one)</p>\n<p>Then I had Visionary look for Off the Rails with her Precognition card. That got rid of the Decoy Projection. Then I had the other heroes beat on Visionary to drive her down to 1 HP in a single round. Then it was a matter of waiting for the second Off the Rails card to appear.</p>\n<p>When it did, Fright Train killed her and then took out another hero with his power, but then it was the next hero’s’ turn (Bowman). He took out the next villain in line. After a harmless incapacitated ability, it was the next hero’s turn (Large Skyscraper) who cleared out the rest.</p>\n<p>It wouldn’t’ve worked if that combo of Unshackled Destiny and Major Flay had popped up after Bowman or Skyscraper had dropped. So there was some luck involved.</p>\n<p>Thanks again.</p>",
