      "created_at": "2026-07-03T19:04:45.562Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So just to be a little less glib: Most of the people on these boards are not just fans of the Sentinels tabletop game, but also avid listeners to the <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Letters Page podcast</a>, where Adam Rebottaro and Christopher Badell, the creators of the game, tell us (and, often, invent as we listen) the stories of the Sentinels Comics universe. The <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/c/general-gtg/sentinel-comics-lore\">Lore</a> section of this forum is all about the podcast.</p>\n<p>“Okay Christopher and Adam, tell us the story” is a half-joking request for them to do a podcast episode describing a comics storyline that reflects the bizarre tabletop interaction described in the original post.</p>",
